// Vulnerable (CWE-601, open redirect): {{ var_name }} -- the caller-
// supplied "return here after login" target -- is set as the redirect's
// Location header verbatim, through Go's ordinary net/http header-writing
// path, with no check at all that it stays on this site. This is a
// genuinely different concern from raw_socket_response_write's own
// CRLF-splicing bypass (CC-LAB-0198): there is no CR/LF stripping to
